⚡🇱🇧🇮🇱 Yedioth Ahronoth newspaper : 32 years after his father was injured in the Suajd (Sughd) region of southern Lebanon, Soldier (A) was seriously injured yesterday morning (Saturday) due to the explosion of a Hezbollah explosive drone in the Ali al-Tahir region.

Note: The strategic area and site of Suajd in Mount Rihan in  Iqlim al Tuffah (Apple region) , southern Lebanon, was liberated through a series of successful military operations, most notably the Islamic Resistance's (Hezbollah) famous storming of the site on September 18, 1986, before its complete liberation and the liberation of the entire area were finalized with the  liberation of 2000.

